"kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149001","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"劳伦斯，那个人是不是在看我们啊？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1631149002:1":{"key":"say:3:1631149002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"别管他，说不定只是个迷路的人。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1631149003:0":{"key":"say:4:1631149003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但要是他再待一会儿，我们可能就得换个地方了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1631149004:1":{"key":"say:6:1631149004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……所以，你刚才说下周的舞会……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1631149005:0":{"key":"say:7:1631149005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"啊？哦，对……舞会……我会准备好礼服的。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1631149006:1":{"key":"say:8:1631149006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"咳……要是只有我们两个就好了，对吧？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1631149007:1":{"key":"say:9:1631149007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嘘！你小点声……别让人误会了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1631149008:1":{"key":"say:10:1631149008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不会的，我说的是舞会。又不是说现在。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1631149009:1":{"key":"say:11:1631149009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631149009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那个，劳伦……这里好像有风，我有点冷了。我们……去图书...","textdes_id":"","document_page_coun